  "description": "Details of external sound level emitted from plant/ machinery pursuant to condition 13 of planning application reference: 193029VAR dated 30.08.2019 \"Application for a Minor Material Amendment (S73) for the variation of condition 2 (Approved Plans) of planning permission ref: 183265FUL dated 06/12/2018 for: 'Demolition of two and three-storey extensions (to north and south of Place House) and replacement with part single, part two and part three-storey extensions for use as a four form entry secondary school and sixth form (840 pupils); refurbishment of Place House, garden folly and gate house; associated hardstanding and boundary treatment works; and refuse and cycle parking storage. Amendments seek approval for alterations  to reconfigure internal layout of the existing listed building (Place House) to comply with fire regulations; changes to the Main Stair, Sixth Form Study Area and the Entrance Exhibition; additional details including new fire doors, ceiling and extended repairs due to mould, and door blockages to match the existing wall construction'\"",
